      "description": "Information for Employees - SUNY Geneseo Skip to content Search this site About About Facts Campus Map Awards & Rankings Diversity News Center Directory Meet Our Faculty Academics Academics Schools and Departments Majors, Minors, and Academic Programs Research Study Abroad Career Design Center Library Admissions Office of Admissions Visit and Connect Apply First Year Transfer Graduate International Tuition And Aid Campus Life Campus Life Clubs and Organizations Events Calendar Residential Communities Dining & Catering Info For Future Students Current Students Faculty And Staff Alumni Parents and Families Community Members Athletics Give Apply Apply Search this site Apply Apply Employee Resources Governance Sponsored Research Teaching and Learning Center Schedule an Event About About Facts Campus Map Awards & Rankings Diversity News Center Directory Meet Our Faculty Academics Academics Schools and Departments Majors, Minors, and Academic Programs Research Study Abroad Career Design Center Library Admissions Office of Admissions Visit and Connect Apply First Year Transfer Graduate International Tuition And Aid Campus Life Campus Life Clubs and Organizations Events Calendar Residential Communities Dining & Catering Info For Future Students Current Students Faculty And Staff Alumni Parents and Families Community Members Athletics Give Home Information for Employees Employee Resources Governance Sponsored Research Teaching and Learning Center Schedule an Event Information for Employees Our faculty and staff play vital roles in fulfilling the Geneseo mission: to develop socially responsible citizens with skills and values important to the pursuit of an enriched life and success in the world. In turn, Geneseo offers talented and dedicated employees a vibrant and welcoming work environment encouraging professional growth and cultural enrichment. Geneseo is more than a place to work. We’re a community. New Employees Work at Geneseo Campus Office Directo