    "https://www.geneseo.edu/provost/applying-for-faculty-positions/": {
      "title": "Applying for Faculty Positions",
      "description": "Applying for Faculty Positions - SUNY Geneseo Skip to content Search this site About About Facts Campus Map Awards & Rankings Diversity News Center Directory Meet Our Faculty Academics Academics Schools and Departments Majors, Minors, and Academic Programs Research Study Abroad Career Design Center Library Admissions Office of Admissions Visit and Connect Apply First Year Transfer Graduate International Tuition And Aid Campus Life Campus Life Clubs and Organizations Events Calendar Residential Communities Dining & Catering Info For Future Students Current Students Faculty And Staff Alumni Parents and Families Community Members Athletics Give Apply Apply Search this site Apply Apply Office of the Provost Provost Office Staff Academic Affairs Divisional Structure Academic Affairs Leadership Teams Distinguished and Award-Winning Faculty and Staff Recent Faculty & Staff Milestones Sabbatical and Other Leaves Academic Affairs Awards Academic Affairs News Academic Affairs Racial Justice Initiatives Applying for Faculty Positions PRODiG+ Fellowship Opportunity Geneseo Curriculum League of Storytellers Workforce Development Contact Us About About Facts Campus Map Awards & Rankings Diversity News Center Directory Meet Our Faculty Academics Academics Schools and Departments Majors, Minors, and Academic Programs Research Study Abroad Career Design Center Library Admissions Office of Admissions Visit and Connect Apply First Year Transfer Graduate International Tuition And Aid Campus Life Campus Life Clubs and Organizations Events Calendar Residential Communities Dining & Catering Info For Future Students Current Students Faculty And Staff Alumni Parents and Families Community Members Athletics Give Home Office of the Provost Applying for Faculty Positions Office of the Provost Provost Office Staff Academic Affairs Divisional Structure Academic Affairs Leadership Teams Distinguished and Award-Winning Faculty and Staff Recent Faculty & Staff Milestones Sabbatical and Other Leaves Academic Affairs Awards Academic Affairs News Academic Affairs Racial Justice Initiatives Applying for Faculty Positions PRODiG+ Fellowship Opportunity Geneseo Curriculum League of Storytellers Workforce Development Contact Us Applying for Faculty Positions Thank you for exploring full-time teaching opportunities at SUNY Geneseo. We are excited that you are interested in becoming a member of our faculty and working with our campus community to prepare students for an enriched life and success in the world. As evidenced by our national rankings , there’s no place like here. We invite you to explore our open positions . SUNY Geneseo’s talented and highly-motivated students will challenge you to be your best. In fact, data from the Higher Education Research Institute survey shows a clear trend of Geneseo faculty having a significantly higher satisfaction level with the quality of our students compared to our peers. The Office of the Provost also is committed to your success. We offer a range of individual faculty development opportunities to support your teaching and research interests. Specific information may be found at the following links in addition to that provided by SUNY Geneseo’s Office of Human Resources . Fulbright Fellowship Program Fulbright Scholar Program Sponsored Research Faculty Internal Funding Teaching & Learning Center Innovation Grant Program The NYS/UUP Joint Labor-Management Committees also provide various funding opportunities , including the Dr. Nuala McGann Drescher Diversity and Inclusion Leave Program and the Individual Development Awards Program. Our Community Commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion expresses our goal to sustain and expand the diversity of our community at Geneseo. We welcome applicants from groups that are historically underrepresented at the College. Please see our Business and Cultural Directory for information about the surrounding community. Quick Links Contact Geneseo Campus Map Directory Emergency Info Quick Links Contact Geneseo Campus Map Directory Emergency Info Join Us Apply to Geneseo Transfer to Geneseo Alumni Community Work at Geneseo Join Us Apply to Geneseo Transfer to Geneseo Alumni Community Work at Geneseo Policies Title IX Policy and Reporting Form Anti-Hazing Policy and Reporting Form Policies Title IX Policy and Reporting Form Anti-Hazing Policy and Reporting Form Website Info Accessibility Privacy Student Right to Know Web Editor Login Website Info Accessibility Privacy Student Right to Know Web Editor Login Copyright © 2026 SUNY Geneseo Facebook Instagram LinkedIn Bluesky YouTube Scroll to Top"
