iation Student Engagement Student Health & Counseling Student Health and Counseling Administration Student Life University Police Division No Selection Academic Affairs Academic Affairs Administration Assoc. Provost Academic Success Assoc. Provost Assessment and Curriculum Assoc. Provost Finance and Administration College Advancement DIV Communications & Marketing DIV Computing & Information Technology Enrollment Management DIV Finance & Administration Institutional Research Milne Library Office of Diversity and Equity DIV Office of the President DIV School of Arts and Sciences School of Business School of Education Student Life Position Type No Selection Staff Faculty Classified Previous 1 2 Next View Results (55\n    ) Posting Number Department Postion Type Job Open Date Job Close Date Assistant Registrar for Transfer Articulation S460 Office of the Registrar Staff 09/03/2026 The Office of the Registrar at SUNY Geneseo provides exceptional service to the college community with the highest standards of integrity, accuracy, efficiency, and security. We collaborate with students, faculty, and staff to provide comprehensive management of enrollment and academic records. Our services include: maintaining academic records within the student information system, processing ... View Details Bookmark Facility Operations Assistant 1 (Grounds), SG-06 C552 Facilities Services Classified 09/03/2026 09/20/2026 HIGHLIGHTSThe SUNY Geneseo Facilities Department is looking for a reliable and dedicated individual to join their Building & Grounds crew. As a Facility Operations Assistant 1 (Grounds), you will perform a variety of routine manual tasks requiring medium to heavy physical effort to assist in the maintenance and repair of buildings, roads, offices, furniture, facilities, and campus landscape... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor (Computational Mathematics) F234 Mathematics Faculty 09/03/2026 The Department of Mathematics at SUNY Geneseo is seeking applicants for a tenure-track Assistant Professor in Computational Mathematics, with emphasis on the Mathematics of Computer Science to begin August 2027.The mathematics of computer science is a broad area at the intersection of mathematics and computer science that investigates the mathematical foundations, design, analysis, and implemen... View Details Bookmark Lecturer, Reading and Literacy F233 School of Education Faculty 08/18/2026 Position Summary: The Ella Cline Shear School of Education at SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for a Lecturer in Reading and Literacy . The School of Education has a long and rich history of preparing teachers who are knowledgeable, skilled in their instructional practices, passionate about their work, and motivated to provide leadership within their profession. Preservice teachers are placed in d... View Details Bookmark Deputy Title IX Coordinator/Equity Compliance Officer S459 Office of Diversity and Equity Staff 08/20/2026 The Title IX Office, within the Office of Diversity and Equity, contributes to campus-wide diversity, equity, and inclusion initiatives in order to integrate Title IX into the larger campus context. The Deputy Title IX Coordinator/Equity Compliance Officer works in collaboration with the Division of Student and Campus Life, Human Resources, Office of Accessibility Services, and other College st... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Student Accounts S456 Student Accounts Staff 08/10/2026 The Assistant Director of Student Accounts plays a vital role on the Student Accounts team. The successful candidate must be a self-motivated, team-oriented individual. Responsibilities include but are not limited to daily reconciliation of cash received; obtaining and reconciling federal student aid and private loan funds; issuing student refunds; working with other College departments, studen... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Assistant Coach '26-'27 (various sports) S389 Intercollegiate Athletics & Rec Staff The SUNY Geneseo Department of Intercollegiate Athletics and Recreation, part of the Division of Student and Campus Life, seeks qualified candidates for the position of Part-Time Assistant Coach for the 2026 – 2027 academic year. This is a pool posting and applicants will be reviewed only when there is a need to fill a position.This part-time, 10-month position will assist in the organization, ... View Details Bookmark Harassment and Discrimination Investigator & Compliance Officer S455 Office of Diversity and Equity Staff 07/22/2026 Serving both SUNY Geneseo and SUNY Fredonia, the Harassment and Discrimination Investigator & Compliance Officer serves as the lead person investigating and resolving complaints of protected class harassment and discrimination, sexual misconduct, gender-based discrimination, intimate partner violence and stalking for students and employees.Some level of on campus presence at both institutio... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Accounting F231 School of Business Faculty 06/30/2026 SUNY Geneseo, New York State’s Public Honors College, seeks a tenure-track Assistant Professor in Accounting for its highly regarded accounting programs. As a nationally recognized public liberal arts college, Geneseo provides a warm and dynamic learning environment for more than four thousand students. The AACSB-accredited School of Business offers six undergraduate majors, including a BS in A... View Details Bookmark ACE Director S449 Enrollment Management Staff 06/08/2026 The ACE Director will oversee the implementation and management of the Advancing Completion through Engagement (ACE) program at SUNY Geneseo. This program is designed to support students in completing their degrees on time by providing comprehensive academic, financial, and personal support. The Director will manage all aspects of the program, ensure fidelity to the established model, and colla... View Details Bookmark ACE Advisor S450 Enrollment Management Staff 06/08/2026 The ACE Advisor will provide individualized academic and personal support to a cohort of students enrolled in the ACE program at SUNY Geneseo. This program is designed to support students in completing their degrees on time by providing comprehensive academic, financial, and personal support. The Advisor plays an essential role in guiding students through their academic journey, helping them na... View Details Bookmark Director of Facilities Operations S448 Facilities Services Staff 06/05/2026 SUNY Geneseo—New York’s Public Honors College—relies on a high performing Facilities Management department to deliver safe, reliable, and sustainable environments that support learning, research, and campus life. The Director of Facilities Operations provides strategic leadership and operational oversight for all campus maintenance, utilities, custodial, and grounds operations.Reporting to the ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Philosophy F228 Philosophy Faculty 03/05/2026 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Philosophy. Course descriptions may be found at: https://www.geneseo.edu/philosophy/course_descriptions/ View Details Bookmark Area Coordinator (26-27 Academic Year) S434 Residence Life Staff 02/03/2026 HIGHLIGHTSThe SUNY Geneseo Department of Residence Life, in partnership with our residents, cultivates an inclusive living and learning environment that sparks engagement, encourages and fosters well being, and inspires a feeling of belonging for all students who live in our community.The Area Coordinator is a professional position in the SUNY Geneseo Division of Student and Campus Life. As suc... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Geological Sciences F008 Geological, Environmental & Planetary Sciences Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Geological Sciences. Possible courses include:GSCI 120/121: Our Geologic Environment and LabGSCI 140/141: Environmental ScienceGSCI 200: Environmental Geology GSCI 300/400 level courses... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer in Finance F011 School of Business Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Finance. Possible teaching assignments include courses on managerial finance (principles), investments, portfolio management or personal finance. Applicant cover letter should address ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer in Marketing F010 School of Business Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Marketing. Possible teaching assignments include courses on principles of marketing, consumer behavior, sales management, marketing communications, internet marketing, or marketing rese... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Accounting F006 School of Business Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Accounting. Possible courses include: Acct 102 Introduction to Financial Accounting Acct 103 Introduction to Managerial Accounting View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Mathematics F004 Mathematics Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Mathematics. Possible courses include:  MATH 112 Precalculus  MATH 221 Calculus I  MATH 222 Calculus II MATH 213 Applied Calculus (for Business majors)  MATH 242 Elements of Probability... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - English F003 English & Creative Writing Faculty 01/10/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in first year writing and introduction to literature. Possible courses include:ENGL 101 Topics in Literature ( 4 credits)ENGL 114 Sustainability and Literature ( 4 credits)INTD 105 First Y... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - History F005 History Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach introductory undergraduate courses in History. Possible courses include:· HIST 112: History Matters (global history)· HIST 161 – Issues in American History· HIST 162 – History Matters, U.S.· HIST 240 – Studies ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Psychology F002 Psychology Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Psychology. Possible courses include: Psyc 100 Introductory Psychology Psyc 202 Educational Psychology Psyc 215 Child Development Psyc 216 Adolescent Development Psyc 250 Psychological... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Philosophy F007 Philosophy Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Philosophy and Western Humanities. Possible courses include: PHIL 100 Introduction to Philosophy HUMN 220 Western Humanities I HUMN 221 Western Humanities II INTD 105 First Year Writing... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Anthropology F009 Anthropology Faculty 01/10/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Duties include teaching undergraduate courses in Anthropology. Possible courses include:ANTH 100 – Introduction to Cultural AnthropologyANTH 101 – Exploration of Human DiversityANTH 2xx – select upper division or spe... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer in Economics F013 School of Business Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Economics. Possible teaching assignments include courses on micro and macro economics, quantitative methods, or econometrics. Applicant cover letter should address prior undergraduate ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Biochemistry F018 Chemistry Faculty 01/10/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Duties may include teaching undergraduate courses in Biochemistry. Possible courses include:• Chem 300: Principles of Biochemistry• Chem 302/304: Biochemistry I and II View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Chemistry F019 Chemistry Faculty 01/10/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed. Teach undergraduate courses in Chemistry. Possible courses include:  • Chem 116/118: Chemistry I and II • Chem 203/204: Principles of Chemistry I and II • Chem 211/213: Organic Chemistry I and II • Chem 223/224: Pri... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Sociology F015 Sociology Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Sociology. Possible courses include:  Sociology 100 Introduction to Sociology View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer-Spanish F036 Global Languages & Cultures Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Spanish. Possible courses include elementary and intermediate Spanish language courses. View Details Bookmark Adjunct Lecturer - Political Science F023 Pol Science & Intern Relations Faculty 01/11/2024 SUNY Geneseo seeks applicants for anticipated part-time temporary adjunct faculty openings. Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis and applicants will be contacted as needed.Teach undergraduate courses in Political Science. Possible courses include:Plsc 110 American PoliticsPlsc 120 Comparative PoliticsPlsc 140 International PoliticsUpper level courses also available. To see the courses ... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
